Package: lytrize
Version: 1.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Lytrize <vnat8638@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), libgl1, libglib2.0-0, libxcb-cursor0
Recommends: chromium-browser | google-chrome-stable | firefox
Description: Lytrize — Offline Data Analysis Platform
 Analyse CSV and Excel files locally with interactive Plotly charts,
 saved dashboards, KPI cards, and optional Supabase cloud sync.
 .
 Features: distribution analysis, time series, correlation, outlier
 detection, categorical charts, map plots, and more.
 .
 Runs entirely offline. Supabase sync is optional and configured
 inside the app under Settings → Sync.
